Package: autoEnrich
Title: Recurrent Pathway Enrichment Across a Threshold Sweep
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Sweeps a numeric column (e.g. log fold-change) across a range
    of thresholds, runs EnrichR pathway enrichment on the resulting gene
    set at each threshold, and plots which pathways recur across multiple
    thresholds. Useful for checking how stable an enrichment result is to
    the exact cutoff used, rather than relying on a single arbitrary
    threshold.
